From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] kernelbase, conhost: console aliases

kernelbase, conhost: console aliases

AddConsoleAlias, GetConsoleAlias, GetConsoleAliases, GetConsoleAliasExes and the
Length functions (A and W) keep and report the alias table of the console, per
executable name, in conhost. GetConsoleAliasesA/W and GetConsoleAliasExesA/W
are exported by kernelbase and kernel32 for the first time.
---
--- a/dlls/kernel32/kernel32.spec
+++ b/dlls/kernel32/kernel32.spec
@@ -589,15 +589,15 @@
 @ stdcall -import GetComputerNameExW(long ptr ptr)
 @ stdcall GetComputerNameW(ptr ptr)
 @ stdcall -import GetConsoleAliasA(str ptr long str)
-@ stub GetConsoleAliasExesA
+@ stdcall -import GetConsoleAliasExesA(ptr long)
 @ stdcall -import GetConsoleAliasExesLengthA()
 @ stdcall -import GetConsoleAliasExesLengthW()
-@ stub GetConsoleAliasExesW
+@ stdcall -import GetConsoleAliasExesW(ptr long)
 @ stdcall -import GetConsoleAliasW(wstr ptr long wstr)
-@ stub GetConsoleAliasesA
+@ stdcall -import GetConsoleAliasesA(ptr long str)
 @ stdcall -import GetConsoleAliasesLengthA(str)
 @ stdcall -import GetConsoleAliasesLengthW(wstr)
-@ stub GetConsoleAliasesW
+@ stdcall -import GetConsoleAliasesW(ptr long wstr)
 @ stdcall -import GetConsoleCP()
 @ stub GetConsoleCharType
 @ stdcall -import GetConsoleCommandHistoryA(ptr long str)
